Because sometimes most of the time I just like to listen to the bird song the sound of the alpacas eating the grass.
因为有时，大多数时候，我只是喜欢听鸟鸣、听羊驼吃草的声音。

32
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:30,951
And just the wind through all of the flowers I just I just really like listening to nature in this time.
还有风吹过花丛的声音。我，我就是很喜欢在这段时间听自然的声音。

33
00:03:30,961 --> 00:03:38,001
But sometimes I do like listening to music I like listening to like beyond with an e soundtrack or a recently tom rosenthal as well.
不过有时我也喜欢听音乐，喜欢听一部剧的原声，还有最近也听 Tom Rosenthal。原声名称识别含混。

34
00:03:38,001 --> 00:03:46,561
And then finally I've got a book um I've brought my solitude poems from the everyman's library pocket poets today.
最后我还带了一本书，嗯，今天带的是 Everyman’s Library Pocket Poets 系列的《独处诗选》，书名待核。

35
